        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-03-31T21:10:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You generally shouldn\u0027t be reading the source path directly from the other module, there\u0027s no guarantee that it is actually a path in the module\u0027s directory.  It could be a module reference (\":module_name\") to a filegroup, genrule, etc.\n\nThe module is already computing the path to its source file, you should export that from the module through an interface or provider.",
      "revId": "f6642fafe27a9a5d33ea42fe8818c3225eaee606",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
